---
// src/components/FinalCTA.astro — Chamada Final de Conversão (15 Vagas)
---

<section class="py-32 px-4 sm:px-8 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#2e224d]">
  <!-- Dot grid fundo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-grid-bg opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Glow central Lime + Purple -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[900px] h-[450px] bg-[#6a5fc1]/10 rounded-full blur-[180px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full badge-glow mb-8" data-anim="fade-up">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] micro-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#c2ef4e] tracking-wide">Apenas 15 Vagas &bull; Turma Alpha 2026</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline -->
    <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6 text-[#ffffff]" data-anim="fade-up">
      Pronto para parar de traduzir e<br /><span class="text-gradient-lime">falar inglês no reflexo?</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-[#cfcfdb] text-base sm:text-lg mb-12 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" data-anim="fade-up">
      Cada aluno na Turma Alpha tem 3 sessões individuais por semana com o professor Gabriel + prática diária com IA. Por isso são apenas 15 vagas estritas.
    </p>

    <!-- Comparação -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-0 sm:divide-x sm:divide-[#3b2c60] mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left" data-anim="fade-up">
      <!-- Modelo Tradicional -->
      <div class="sm:pr-10 pb-8 sm:pb-0">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#ffb287] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 font-bold">Método Tradicional de Cursinho</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[#cfcfdb]">
          {[
            'O Lag dos 3 Segundos: traduzir na mente antes de falar',
            'Anos pagando mensalidade alta sem destravar uma reunião',
            'Caneta vermelha que gera medo e vergonha de errar',
            'Aulas longas de 1h cansativas onde 80% é esquecido'
          ].map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#ffb287] shrink-0 mt-0.5">&times;</span>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <!-- Método SPARK -->
      <div class="sm:pl-10 pt-8 sm:pt-0">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#c2ef4e] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 font-bold">Turma Alpha · Método SPARK</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[#ffffff]">
          {[
            '3 sessões individuais por semana com o professor Gabriel',
            'Sparring diário 24/7 no LibreChat com Spaced Recasting',
            'Portal do Aluno com atividades guiadas e gravações',
            'R$ 197/mês (preço travado) + Garantia incondicional 30 dias via Pix'
          ].map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c2ef4e] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto" data-anim="fade-up">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5511967239791?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gabe!%20Quero%20uma%20das%2015%20vagas%20da%20Turma%20Alpha%20por%20R$%20197/m%C3%AAs"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-4 px-8 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] text-[#1f1633] font-sans font-extrabold text-base hover:bg-[#b0dc41] active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-[#c2ef4e]/20 group cursor-pointer"
      >
        <span>Garantir Minha Vaga no WhatsApp</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <p class="text-[#cfcfdb] text-xs mt-4 font-mono">
        Apenas 15 vagas fundadoras &bull; Atendimento direto com Gabriel Lima &bull; R$ 197/mês
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  function ready(fn) {
    if (document.readyState !== 'loading') fn(); else document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', fn);
  }
  ready(function () {
    var gsap = window.gsap;
    var ST = window.ScrollTrigger;
    if (!gsap || !ST || reduced) return;
    var els = document.querySelectorAll('section:last-of-type [data-anim="fade-up"]');
    if (!els.length) return;
    gsap.from(els, {
      y: 35,
      opacity: 0,
      duration: 0.85,
      stagger: 0.1,
      ease: 'power3.out',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: 'section:last-of-type',
        start: 'top 80%'
      }
    });
  });
})();
</script>
